  "visual_review": [
    "Eleven production-renderer color controls retain distinct requests through focus changes, per-pane opacity, missing keys, retirement and replacement. Black missing/retired contexts reject an unrelated legacy same-layer texture.",
    "Eight production timeline rows fit phone 320 px and desktop 1000 px bounds; native forecast positions and model/run group selection remain accessible.",
    "Four Sources panels fit 240/300 px bounds. Owners are visible in row prefixes, details wrap, and a separately fetching/failed pinned request does not borrow the shared loaded request status or timestamp."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic renderer controls establish resource ownership, not meteorological validation.",
    "No simultaneous full application live/archive/different-run operator session or live provider acceptance claimed.",
    "WASM compilation does not certify browser runtime; no physical Android acceptance claimed.",
    "Independent analysis-time/camera/site/cursor groups, MRMS/GOES drivers and comparison/ensemble/contour ownership remain open.",
    "Latest run keys are refreshable aliases; accepted fields retain their actual provider cycle and valid time.",
    "Existing WASM and PDB filename warnings remain in local logs. Tornado detection methodology remains assigned to Claude."
  ]
